version 0.0.1

// @vibe/wasi — umbrella package for the WASI surfaces (ADR-0070 Phase 3,
// #897). The real APIs live in the NESTED contract packages
// @vibe/wasi/p2 (Preview 2: fd-based HTTP + TCP sockets, sync/pollable)
// and @vibe/wasi/p3 (Preview 3: async/component-model handler) — per
// ADR-0070 a nested index.vpkg starts its own package, so p2/ and p3/ are
// NOT owned by this contract (implicit membership covers only regular
// *.vibe in THIS directory, no recursive subdirectory discovery; wit/
// holds vendored WIT, no vibe sources). This package's own surface is just
// the version marker the old hand-written index.vibe facade exported.
//
// `version` was `export let version = "0.0.1"` directly in the old
// index.vibe facade — a real importable binding, not just contract
// metadata — preserved as an implementation-file value (wasi.vibe) with a
// matching bodyless declaration here (Codex review precedent, PR #914).

import ./wasi.vibe {}

let version: String
